{"id":"n5_u10_l1","unit_id":"n5_u10","instructional_level":"N5","title":"Days of the week","goal":"Say and recognise the seven days of the week.","introduces":{"vocab":["v_wd_nichi","v_wd_getsu","v_wd_ka","v_wd_sui","v_wd_moku","v_wd_kin","v_wd_do","v_nanyoubi"]},"explain":[{"heading":"Seven days","body":["Each day ends in ようび: げつようび (Mon), かようび (Tue), すいようび (Wed), もくようび (Thu), きんようび (Fri), どようび (Sat), にちようび (Sun). Ask なんようび."],"examples":[{"ja":"きょう は なんようび です か","reading":"kyou wa nanyoubi desu ka","en":"What day of the week is it today?"}]}],"practice":{"question_ids":["q_n5u10_wd01","q_n5u10_wd02","q_n5u10_wd03","q_n5u10_wd04","q_n5u10_wd05","q_n5u10_wd06","q_n5u10_wd07","q_n5u10_ty01","q_n5u10_ty02","q_n5u10_dc01","q_n5u10_gl01"]},"exit_check":{"question_ids":["q_n5u10_wd01","q_n5u10_wd03","q_n5u10_wd05","q_n5u10_wd07","q_n5u10_ty01","q_n5u10_gl01"],"pass":0.7},"provenance":"orig"},
{"id":"n5_u10_l2","unit_id":"n5_u10","instructional_level":"N5","title":"Months","goal":"Say the twelve months, including the irregular ones.","introduces":{"vocab":["v_mo_01","v_mo_02","v_mo_03","v_mo_04","v_mo_05","v_mo_06","v_mo_07","v_mo_08","v_mo_09","v_mo_10","v_mo_11","v_mo_12","v_nangatsu"]},"explain":[{"heading":"Number + がつ","body":["いちがつ, にがつ, さんがつ ... but しがつ (April), しちがつ (July), くがつ (September) use the old readings し, しち and く."],"examples":[{"ja":"しがつ","reading":"shigatsu","en":"April"}]}],"practice":{"question_ids":["q_n5u10_mm01","q_n5u10_mm02","q_n5u10_mm03","q_n5u10_mm04","q_n5u10_mm05","q_n5u10_mm06","q_n5u10_mmt01","q_n5u10_ty03","q_n5u10_ty04","q_n5u10_dc02","q_n5u10_gl02"]},"exit_check":{"question_ids":["q_n5u10_mm01","q_n5u10_mm02","q_n5u10_mm03","q_n5u10_mmt01","q_n5u10_ty04","q_n5u10_gl02"],"pass":0.7},"provenance":"orig"},
{"id":"n5_u10_l3","unit_id":"n5_u10","instructional_level":"N5","title":"Days of the month","goal":"Say the dates, including the irregular days.","introduces":{"vocab":["v_dy_d01","v_dy_d02","v_dy_d03","v_dy_d04","v_dy_d05","v_dy_d06","v_dy_d07","v_dy_d08","v_dy_d09","v_dy_d10","v_dy_d14","v_dy_d20","v_dy_d24","v_nannichi","v_tanjoubi"],"grammar":["g_dates_weekdays"]},"explain":[{"heading":"Irregular days","body":["Most days are number + にち (じゅうごにち). But the 1st to 10th, the 14th, the 20th and the 24th are special words: ついたち, ふつか, みっか, よっか, いつか, むいか, なのか, ようか, ここのか, とおか, じゅうよっか, はつか, にじゅうよっか.","Say the month, then the day: ごがつ ふつか."],"examples":[{"ja":"たんじょうび は ろくがつ とおか です","reading":"tanjoubi wa rokugatsu tooka desu","en":"My birthday is June 10."}]}],"practice":{"question_ids":["q_n5u10_dmt01","q_n5u10_dmt02","q_n5u10_dm01","q_n5u10_dm02","q_n5u10_dm03","q_n5u10_gc01","q_n5u10_gc02","q_n5u10_gc03","q_n5u10_gc04","q_n5u10_gc05","q_n5u10_gc06","q_n5u10_ty05","q_n5u10_ty06","q_n5u10_dc03","q_n5u10_gl03","q_n5u10_gl04","q_n5u10_so01","q_n5u10_tr02","q_n5u10_vm_nannichi","q_n5u10_vm_tanjoubi"]},"exit_check":{"question_ids":["q_n5u10_dmt01","q_n5u10_dm02","q_n5u10_gc01","q_n5u10_gc02","q_n5u10_gc04","q_n5u10_ty06","q_n5u10_gl03"],"pass":0.7},"provenance":"orig"},
{"id":"n5_u10_l4","unit_id":"n5_u10","instructional_level":"N5","title":"Yesterday, last week, next year","goal":"Place events in time.","introduces":{"vocab":["v_kinou","v_ototoi","v_senshuu","v_konshuu","v_raishuu","v_sengetsu","v_kongetsu","v_raigetsu","v_kyonen","v_kotoshi","v_rainen","v_maiasa","v_maiban","v_shuumatsu","v_ryokou"],"grammar":["g_relative_time"]},"explain":[{"heading":"Relative time words","body":["せん = last, こん = this, らい = next, まい = every: せんしゅう, こんげつ, らいねん, まいあさ. Special: きのう, おととい, きょねん, ことし."],"examples":[{"ja":"らいげつ りょこう を します","reading":"raigetsu ryokou o shimasu","en":"I will take a trip next month."}]}],"practice":{"question_ids":["q_n5u10_gr01","q_n5u10_gr02","q_n5u10_gr03","q_n5u10_gr04","q_n5u10_gr05","q_n5u10_gr06","q_n5u10_ty07","q_n5u10_ty08","q_n5u10_ty09","q_n5u10_ty10","q_n5u10_dc04","q_n5u10_tr01","q_n5u10_tr03","q_n5u10_tr04","q_n5u10_tr05","q_n5u10_tr06","q_n5u10_tr07","q_n5u10_vm_kinou","q_n5u10_vm_ototoi","q_n5u10_vm_senshuu","q_n5u10_vm_konshuu","q_n5u10_vm_raishuu","q_n5u10_vm_sengetsu","q_n5u10_vm_kongetsu","q_n5u10_vm_raigetsu","q_n5u10_vm_kyonen","q_n5u10_vm_kotoshi","q_n5u10_vm_rainen","q_n5u10_vm_maiasa","q_n5u10_vm_maiban","q_n5u10_vm_shuumatsu","q_n5u10_vm_ryokou"]},"exit_check":{"question_ids":["q_n5u10_gr01","q_n5u10_gr02","q_n5u10_gr03","q_n5u10_gr04","q_n5u10_ty07","q_n5u10_tr04","q_n5u10_dc04"],"pass":0.7},"provenance":"orig"},
{"id":"n5_u10_l5","unit_id":"n5_u10","instructional_level":"N5","title":"Polite past of verbs","goal":"Say what you did and did not do.","introduces":{"grammar":["g_past_verbs"]},"explain":[{"heading":"ました and ませんでした","body":["Replace ます with ました for the past: みます → みました. The negative past is ませんでした."],"examples":[{"ja":"きのう えいが を みました","reading":"kinou eiga o mimashita","en":"I watched a movie yesterday."}]}],"practice":{"question_ids":["q_n5u10_gp01","q_n5u10_gp02","q_n5u10_gp03","q_n5u10_gp04","q_n5u10_gp05","q_n5u10_gp06","q_n5u10_gp07","q_n5u10_gl05","q_n5u10_gl06"]},"exit_check":{"question_ids":["q_n5u10_gp01","q_n5u10_gp02","q_n5u10_gp03","q_n5u10_gp04","q_n5u10_gp06","q_n5u10_gl05"],"pass":0.7},"provenance":"orig"},
{"id":"n5_u10_l6","unit_id":"n5_u10","instructional_level":"N5","title":"Past of です and adjectives","goal":"Say how things were.","introduces":{"vocab":["v_tenki","v_ame","v_hare","v_kumori"],"grammar":["g_past_desu_adjectives"]},"explain":[{"heading":"でした and かった","body":["です → でした (negative: じゃ ありません でした). い-adjectives: drop い, add かった: たのしかった です; negative: たのしくなかった です. いい becomes よかった."],"examples":[{"ja":"りょこう は たのしかった です","reading":"ryokou wa tanoshikatta desu","en":"The trip was fun."}]}],"practice":{"question_ids":["q_n5u10_gq01","q_n5u10_gq02","q_n5u10_gq03","q_n5u10_gq04","q_n5u10_gq05","q_n5u10_gq06","q_n5u10_gq07","q_n5u10_gl07","q_n5u10_gl08","q_n5u10_so02","q_n5u10_tr08","q_n5u10_tr09","q_n5u10_tr10","q_n5u10_vm_tenki","q_n5u10_vm_ame","q_n5u10_vm_hare","q_n5u10_vm_kumori"]},"exit_check":{"question_ids":["q_n5u10_gq01","q_n5u10_gq02","q_n5u10_gq03","q_n5u10_gq04","q_n5u10_gq06","q_n5u10_gl07","q_n5u10_tr09"],"pass":0.7},"provenance":"orig"},
{"id":"n5_u10_l7","unit_id":"n5_u10","instructional_level":"N5","title":"Kanji: 日月火水木金土年今何","goal":"Read the calendar kanji.","introduces":{"kanji":["k_nichi","k_getsu","k_ka","k_sui","k_moku","k_kin","k_do","k_toshi","k_ima","k_nani"]},"explain":[{"heading":"Calendar kanji","body":["月火水木金土日 are the weekday kanji: moon, fire, water, tree, gold, earth, sun. 年 is year, 今 is now, 何 is what: 何月 (what month), 何日 (what day), 今月 (this month)."],"examples":[{"ja":"五月","reading":"gogatsu","en":"May"},{"ja":"今年","reading":"kotoshi","en":"this year"}]}],"practice":{"question_ids":["q_n5u10_kd01","q_n5u10_kd02","q_n5u10_kd03","q_n5u10_kd04","q_n5u10_kd05","q_n5u10_kd06","q_n5u10_kd07","q_n5u10_kd08","q_n5u10_kd09","q_n5u10_kd10","q_n5u10_kk01","q_n5u10_kk02","q_n5u10_kk03","q_n5u10_kk04","q_n5u10_kk05","q_n5u10_kk06","q_n5u10_kk07","q_n5u10_kk08","q_n5u10_kmt01","q_n5u10_kmt02","q_n5u10_kcf01","q_n5u10_kcf02","q_n5u10_kcf03"]},"exit_check":{"question_ids":["q_n5u10_kd01","q_n5u10_kd02","q_n5u10_kd05","q_n5u10_kd06","q_n5u10_kd10","q_n5u10_kk02","q_n5u10_kk03","q_n5u10_kmt01","q_n5u10_kcf02"],"pass":0.7},"provenance":"orig"},
{"id":"n5_u10_l8","unit_id":"n5_u10","instructional_level":"N5","title":"Changing trains","goal":"Understand simple transfer announcements and ask where to change.","introduces":{"vocab":["v_norikae","v_hoomu","v_tsugi","v_senrosen","v_ato","v_norikaemasu"]},"explain":[{"heading":"Station words","body":["のりかえ (transfer), ホーム (platform), つぎ (next), せん (line), あと (in), のりかえます (change trains). A slow announcement: つぎ の でんしゃ は あと ごふん です."],"examples":[{"ja":"さんばんせん で のりかえます","reading":"sanbansen de norikaemasu","en":"Change at platform 3."}]}],"practice":{"question_ids":["q_n5u10_dg01","q_n5u10_dg02","q_n5u10_dg03","q_n5u10_dg04","q_n5u10_dg05","q_n5u10_dg06","q_n5u10_tr11","q_n5u10_tr12","q_n5u10_so03","q_n5u10_dc05","q_n5u10_gl09","q_n5u10_gl10","q_n5u10_gl11","q_n5u10_gl12","q_n5u10_vm_norikae","q_n5u10_vm_hoomu","q_n5u10_vm_tsugi","q_n5u10_vm_senrosen","q_n5u10_vm_ato","q_n5u10_vm_norikaemasu"]},"exit_check":{"question_ids":["q_n5u10_dg02","q_n5u10_dg04","q_n5u10_tr11","q_n5u10_so03","q_n5u10_dc05","q_n5u10_gl09","q_n5u10_gl10"],"pass":0.7},"provenance":"orig"},
